245
00:10:03,500 --> 00:10:05,500
And they go. well, that's troop policy,

246
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:07,500
That's what we've been doing.

247
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:09,500
I said, okay,

248
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:11,500
Because I wasn't about to

249
00:10:11,500 --> 00:10:13,500
change that

250
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:15,500
You weren't going to have a bear in that fight.

251
00:10:15,500 --> 00:10:17,500
No, I don't think so.

252
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:19,500
Well, I think it's important to think about that.

253
00:10:19,500 --> 00:10:21,500
Here's what I hear.

254
00:10:21,500 --> 00:10:23,500
is that a lot of times,

255
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:25,500
unit leaders- and we're mostly

256
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:27,500
talking to Scoutmasters,

